### Health check (is the key configured?)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### Transcribe a recording (put a file in samples/ and update the name below)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/transcribe
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="audio"; filename="test.m4a"
Content-Type: audio/mp4

< ../samples/test.m4a
--boundary--
